# This repo is developed on Windows but every script here is executed inside a
# Linux container. With core.autocrlf=true a clone would rewrite these to CRLF,
# which breaks `#!/bin/sh` ("no such file or directory") and make recipes.
# Pin them to LF so a Windows checkout still produces working containers.
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.sql     text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf
